5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry we focus on flashy demos instead of daily floor losses.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"Honestly, I’m tired of proposals that ignore who actually does the work.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We keep promising dates based on assumptions no one has verified.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to know where the money comes from before we pick anything.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Why do we keep picking projects that fail in the same way?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Kenji, do you have specific examples of those failures?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, budget is fine, but who covers the overtime?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, floor losses are real, but are they measurable?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, overtime is a symptom. The root is unclear funding sources.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Daisuke, yes, the last three rollouts all stalled at month six.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I want to see the incident logs to understand the actual downtime.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I’m checking the staffing of the coordination group to see who’s drowning.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll look into network coverage at customer plants. That’s always the blind spot.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I’m investigating the capital budget and software allowance. That’s my priority.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I’m looking into the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I also want to check the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I’m also checking the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’m also checking the in-house developer availability. We can’t build on air.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I’m also checking the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m also checking the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
