35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The logs show eleven misrouted deliveries, all from duplicate address records.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, that’s exactly why I checked the staffing. Two people are doing the work of five.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, staffing is a symptom. The real issue is the network.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the network is fine. The budget is the problem.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Daisuke, the last three rollouts show the same pattern. Daily entry tools get dropped.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Kenji, I found we lose an hour daily just copying records.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, that’s the smoking gun. We treat staff time as free.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the network isn’t fine. Half the customer sites lose coverage for hours.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, coverage is a vendor issue. The budget is a company issue.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, the pattern is clear. We fund tools that need everyone to type.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, if the network is down, the copying problem gets worse.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, yes. The coordination group is drowning because the network fails.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, exactly. The network is the root. The copying is the symptom.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
